  },
  "refutes_exact_assertion": {
    "conclusion_quote": "the counterexample fails to refute the existence or validity of the stated relationship.",
    "justification_quote": "The literal assertion 'cytoplasm contains tracks for transport' is compatible with the fact that microtubules are those tracks. The counterexample claims this phrasing implies microtubules are separate entities, which is a logical leap not supported by the text. Since the assertion allows for the tracks to be the microtubules themselves (as they are indeed contained in the cytoplasm), the counterexample fails to refute the existence or validity of the stated relationship.",
